# ✨ Personalized New Tab – Your Smart Browser Dashboard

Say goodbye to boring new tabs! This project transforms your browser’s default tab into a **sleek, intelligent dashboard** that displays the **current time**, **date**, **weather**, and even lets you **talk to an AI assistant** — all in one elegant interface.

---

## 🌟 Why This Project?

Most browser new tabs are static and uninspiring. This project reimagines that space as something **dynamic**, **useful**, and even a little fun!

When you open a new tab, instead of just a blank page, you’ll get:

- 🕒 A beautifully formatted **time & date display**  
- ⛅ Live **weather updates** based on your location  
- 🎤 **Voice-enabled assistant** to answer your questions  
- 🗣️ **Text-to-speech** for hands-free interaction  
- 💬 AI-powered chat (Groq/Mistral-ready)  
- 💻 Fully responsive, lightweight, and built with modern web tech  

Think of it as your own **personal dashboard** — minimal, helpful, and designed for daily use.

---

## ✅ Ideal Use Cases

- 📆 Stay informed about the time/date every time you open a tab
- ☁️ Instantly check the weather before heading out
- 🧠 Chat with an AI for quick questions, definitions, reminders, etc.
- 🚀 Boost productivity with a focused, clutter-free environment

